OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain across
OL,7,Fthe region through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, which could be occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy. Wind easing this evening. A
OL,10,Fmild night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet start with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, occasionally heavy. Likely
OL,14,Fbecoming drier for the afternoon but
OL,15,Fremaining mostly cloudy. Possible
OL,16,Ffurther rain during the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
