OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fbrighter day with isolated showers on
OL,7,FThursday. Further spells of
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers on
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday, but with some
OL,10,Fdrier interludes. Occasionally breezy.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
